      "body": "[`keypress()`](https://drafts.csswg.org/animation-triggers-1/#funcdef-event-function-keypress) is defined `for=\"event-function\"` but it should be `for=\"<event-function>\"` as this creates a [dangling value](ed/css/animation-triggers.json#L476) in `w3c/webref`, because it cannot find the `event-function` property definition.\n\ncc @tidoust",
